# A harness path loses its code owner (ADR-0044)
command: cargo xtask hygiene
expect: .github/CODEOWNERS has no owner line for harness path `xtask/`
--- patch
diff --git a/.github/CODEOWNERS b/.github/CODEOWNERS
--- a/.github/CODEOWNERS
+++ b/.github/CODEOWNERS
@@ -9,7 +9,6 @@
 /.githooks/ @Ben-Gee
 /.github/ @Ben-Gee
 /.cargo/ @Ben-Gee
-/xtask/ @Ben-Gee
 /harness/ @Ben-Gee
 /Cargo.toml @Ben-Gee
 /clippy.toml @Ben-Gee
